{{!
    @template block_pulso/chat_create_tools

    Lista de herramientas de la pestana Crear: una fila por herramienta (icono, nombre y una linea).
    Sin Epica solo queda «Ampliar recurso», que no es una creacion (no se guarda).
    El orden es el de la pila de pantallas: esta lista es la raiz, cada fila abre el formulario.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * cancreate - true con block/pulso:createactivity
    * epica - true si local_awkepica esta disponible (infografia, juego y reto)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cancreate": true,
        "epica": true
    }
}}
{{#cancreate}}
<ul class="pulso-tools" id="pulso-tools">
{{#epica}}
        <li>
            <button type="button" class="pulso-tool" data-pulso-action="openCreatePanel" data-pulso-arg="infografia" data-pulso-tool="infografia">
                <span class="pulso-tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="pulso-tool-text">
                    <span class="pulso-tool-title">Infografía</span>
                    <span class="pulso-tool-sub">Resume un recurso del curso en una imagen</span>
                </span>
                <svg class="pulso-tool-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
            </button>
        </li>
        <li>
            <button type="button" class="pulso-tool" data-pulso-action="openCreatePanel" data-pulso-arg="gamificacion" data-pulso-tool="gamificacion">
                <span class="pulso-tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2"/><line x1="6" y1="12" x2="10" y2="12"/><line x1="8" y1="10" x2="8" y2="14"/><line x1="15" y1="13" x2="15.01" y2="13"/><line x1="18" y1="11" x2="18.01" y2="11"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="pulso-tool-text">
                    <span class="pulso-tool-title">Juego</span>
                    <span class="pulso-tool-sub">Practica un recurso con un juego interactivo</span>
                </span>
                <svg class="pulso-tool-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
            </button>
        </li>
{{/epica}}
        <li>
            <button type="button" class="pulso-tool" data-pulso-action="openCreatePanel" data-pulso-arg="ampliacion" data-pulso-tool="ampliacion">
                <span class="pulso-tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/><line x1="11" y1="8" x2="11" y2="14"/><line x1="8" y1="11" x2="14" y2="11"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="pulso-tool-text">
                    <span class="pulso-tool-title">Ampliar recurso</span>
                    <span class="pulso-tool-sub">Vídeos y artículos para profundizar en un recurso</span>
                </span>
                <svg class="pulso-tool-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
            </button>
        </li>
{{#epica}}
        <li>
            <button type="button" class="pulso-tool" data-pulso-action="openCreatePanel" data-pulso-arg="retos" data-pulso-tool="retos">
                <span class="pulso-tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="pulso-tool-text">
                    <span class="pulso-tool-title">Reto</span>
                    <span class="pulso-tool-sub">Un caso práctico que corrige la IA</span>
                </span>
                <svg class="pulso-tool-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
            </button>
        </li>
{{/epica}}
</ul>
{{/cancreate}}
